<div id="pfc" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="c"><div class="pc pcc w0 h0"><img class="bi x0 yfc w1 h22" alt="" src="bgc.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">3<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>数据链路层</span></div><div class="t m0 xb h12 y11 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">第<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff6">3<span class="_ _19"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _19"> </span><span class="ff9 fc7"><span class="_ _19"> </span></span>数据链路层</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y65 ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">3.1<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">流量控制<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>(Flo<span class="_ _29"></span>w<span class="_ _5"> </span>Control)</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y140 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">流量控制是数据链路层和传输<span class="_ _f"></span>层的重要机制，其目的是控制发送方的发送速率，<span class="_ _f"></span>以确保接收方来得及接收，</div><div class="t m0 x3 h7 y141 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">防止数据丢失。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y142 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.1.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">停止等待协议<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(Stop-and-<span class="_ _29"></span>W<span class="_ _4"></span>ait)</div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y143 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">这是最简单的流量控制协议。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y144 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">基本原理<span class="ff4">：发送方每发送完一个数据帧，<span class="_ _29"></span>就停止发送，等待接收方的确认<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(A<span class="_ _29"></span>CK)<span class="ff4">。只有收到确认后，<span class="_ _3"></span>才继</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y145 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">续发送下一帧。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y146 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">窗口大小<span class="ff4">：发送窗口<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑊</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x55 h17 y147 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 x56 h7 y146 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">1<span class="ff4">，接收窗口<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑊</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x57 h17 y147 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑅</div><div class="t m0 x4b h7 y146 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">1<span class="ff4">。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y148 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">优缺点<span class="ff4">：实现简单，但信道利用率极低。在往返时间<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(R<span class="_ _3"></span>TT)<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">较大的信道（如卫星通信）中效率严重受限。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y149 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">信道利用率<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(<span class="_ _3"></span><span class="ff8">𝑈<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff6">)<span class="ff4">：</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 xc h18 y14a ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑈<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ffd">=</span></div><div class="t m0 x2b h18 y14b ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑡</div><div class="t m0 x3a h17 y14c ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑋</div><div class="t m0 x3e h18 y14d ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑡</div><div class="t m0 x31 h17 y14e ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑋</div><div class="t m0 x1a h1a y14d ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">+<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑅𝑇<span class="_ _11"></span>𝑇</span></div><div class="t m0 x3d h8 y14a ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(3.1)</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y14f ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">其中<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑡</span></div><div class="t m0 x58 h17 y150 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇<span class="_ _11"> </span>𝑋</div><div class="t m0 x59 h7 y14f ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">为发送时延，<span class="_ _f"></span><span class="ff8">𝑅𝑇<span class="_ _f"></span>𝑇<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>为往返时间。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y151 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.1.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">滑动窗口协议<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>(Sliding<span class="_ _28"> </span>Windo<span class="_ _3"></span>w)</div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y152 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">为了提高信道利用率，允许发送方在收到确认之前连续发送多个数据帧。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y153 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">基本概念</div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y154 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">发送窗口<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(<span class="_ _3"></span><span class="ff8">𝑊</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x20 h17 y155 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 x1f h7 y154 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">)<span class="ff4">：在未收到确认的情况下，发送方允许连续发送的最大帧数。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y156 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">接收窗口<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(<span class="_ _3"></span><span class="ff8">𝑊</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x5a h17 y157 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑅</div><div class="t m0 x5b h7 y156 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">)<span class="ff4">：接收方允许接收并缓存的帧序号范围。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y158 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">累积确认<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _2c"></span>接收方不必对收到的每个分组逐个发送确认，<span class="_ _2c"></span>而是在收到几个分组后，<span class="_ _2c"></span>对按序到达的最后</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y159 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">一个分组发送确认。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y15a ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">ARQ<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">协议的分类</span></div><div class="t m0 x24 h6 y15b ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">连续<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">ARQ<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>协议</span></div><div class="t m0 x4d h6 y15c ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">窗口特征<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _3"></span><span class="ff8">𝑊</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x5c h17 y15d ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑇</div><div class="t m0 x5d h7 y15c ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">&gt;<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">1<span class="ff4">，但<span class="_ _8"> </span></span></span>𝑊</div><div class="t m0 x5e h17 y15d ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑅</div><div class="t m0 x5f h7 y15c ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">1<span class="ff4">。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x4d h6 y15e ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">工作机制<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x34 h7 y15f ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">接收方只能按序接收数据。</div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _25"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">7<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _25"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
